From 19bb64a28114efb1307085df702a0c46b9e4ca6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Pivoto <>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:23:02 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(smf): Nchf_ConvergedCharging consumer (online
 charging before the PDU session)

The SMF discovers the CHF through the NRF (target-nf-type=CHF) and sends a
ChargingDataRequest (SUPI, PDU session id, DNN, S-NSSAI, charging id) right
after the SM policy association; the PDU session is rejected when the CHF
does not grant the quota. The ChargingDataRef from the Location header is
released when the session is removed. Without a registered CHF the SMF
works as before (offline mode).
